      "note": "When the input buffer runs out (c == 0) before all 4 hex digits of the unicode escape are consumed (st_pos != 0), the code fails to require st_pos == 0 (a fully-formed escape) before deciding to flush output, so it treats an incomplete escape as if it were resolvable."
